Package: bacoR
Type: Package
Title: Robust Inference for Bias Attributable to Composite Outcomes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("José Mário", "Nunes da Silva",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "zemariu@hotmail.com")
Description: Tools for estimation and inference for the Bias Attributable to
    Composite Outcome (BACO) index. The package separates estimation of the
    BACO ratio from testing of composite-critical effect discrepancy, provides
    Fieller confidence sets for ratio inference, exact conditional inference
    for nested binary aggregate outcomes, coefficient-based and fitted-model
    inference using joint sampling covariance, optional joint bootstrap
    validation, and diagnostics for weak-denominator and zero-event settings.
